fix: use ssl.enable instead of starttls.enable for port 465 (SMTPS)

Port 465 uses implicit TLS — the SMTP connection is wrapped in SSL from
the start. starttls.enable is for port 587 where the connection starts
plain and then upgrades. Using starttls on port 465 causes the client
to read TLS handshake bytes as plaintext, hanging until timeout.
